TTFT is not a bound, and is validated only where its figure says so: the P2 recordings never checked it at a stated Ca^2; the measured envelope did only where a figure reads validated. Above Ca^2 1 it reads high at light load: on one pod at Ca^2 4 its p95 read +118% at utilization 0.3 and +10% at 0.85 against a simulation.
